{"id":"638949","name":"南瓜发糕","author":"雪玥美食家","authorId":"12929721","desc":"","cover":"images/638949/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"南瓜","amount":"250g"}],"sub":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"250g"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"南瓜洗净削皮。","img":"images/638949/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"切片，上锅蒸熟。","img":"images/638949/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒸好的南瓜，加鸡蛋，加白糖压成泥。","img":"images/638949/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放酵母粉。","img":"images/638949/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加面粉，面粉根据南瓜的水性添加，搅拌浓稠面糊。","img":"images/638949/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"醒发两倍大。","img":"images/638949/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"搅匀。","img":"images/638949/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"在盆底刷油倒入盆里。","img":"images/638949/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再次醒发，放上大枣点缀。","img":"images/638949/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"上蒸锅蒸30到40分钟。","img":"images/638949/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"南瓜发糕就好了。","img":"images/638949/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}